SUMMARY:The Blue Blessing
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Would you like t
 he opportunity for:**\n\n* **Spiritual liberation in this lifetime?**\n* *
 *The ability to change one’s fate?**\n* **Release from the cycle of karm
 a and reincarnation?**\n\nThe teachings of ECKANKAR are based on God’s l
 ove and spiritual freedom for everyone. It offers individual spiritual too
 ls\, whatever your path or religion may be\, to bring you more understandi
 ng\, love\, and help in these challenging times.\n\nKey to the ECK teachin
 gs is the presence of a spiritual guide\, who can work with individuals ou
 twardly as the Living ECK Master\, by providing spiritual guidance through
  books and talks\, and inwardly through dreams\, inner guidance\, Soul Tra
 vel and one's contemplation. In Eckankar\, we know this inner guide as the
  Mahanta.\n\n* **What is the Blue Blessing?**\n\nThis blue light often app
 ears during contemplation. It tells of the presence of the MAHANTA. The Bl
 ue Light comes to render a blessing\, give consolation to the heart\, assu
 rance to the spirit\, and healing to the body.\n— Harold Klemp\, ECKANKA
 R\, the Art of Spirituality\, pg 33.\n\nIn Eckankar\, the Mahanta\, someti
 mes seen as a Blue Light or Blue Star\, is the expression of the Spirit of
  God that is always with you. The Living Eck Master is the Divine Spirit p
 ersonified—a living embodiment of all that is spiritual.\n\nTogether the
 y form the Living Word that has always been present throughout time. Altho
 ugh the face of the Living ECK Master changes\, the Mahanta is ever presen
 t in Its expression as the Living ECK Master.\n\nAt the meetup we will del
 ve into the unique spiritual blessings the Mahanta\, the Living ECK Master
  offers such as spiritual liberation and release from the wheel of karma a
 nd reincarnation in this lifetime.\n\nCome with your questions and curiosi
 ty as we explore the ways Eckankar can open your heart to your own persona
 l and unique connection with the Divine.\n\nWe hope you join us for this e
 xciting discussion on how ECKANKAR\, The Path of Spiritual Freedom\, could
  possibly be your next spiritual step to reach your spiritual goals.\n\nCo
 me\, stay as long as you like\, and explore spiritual resources that can h
 elp you\, at your own pace. Feel free to come and to go as you wish.\nTher
 e is no pressure\, expectation\, judgment\, or unasked-for follow up.\n\n*
 *We respect your divinity as a spiritual being.**\n\n**We honor your choic
 es and your journey.**
