SUMMARY:Living the Spiritual Life—Spiritual Parenting Chat
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Are your days fi
 lled with school\, sports\, clubs\, playdates?**\n\n**Is it sometimes chal
 lenging to find time for warm\, joyful connections in the family?**\n\n**W
 ould you like to discover ways to encourage your child to incorporate**\n*
 *their spiritual goals into all their activities?**\n\n**You are warmly in
 vited to come share your stories!**\n“An unselfish dream\, goal\, or ser
 vice can help us to the height of spiritual living.”\n—Harold Klemp\, 
 *The Spiritual Life\,* p. 117\n\n***Explore. . .***\n\n* Sharing tips to i
 mbue our family moments with joy\, playfulness\, and laughter.\n* Finding 
 ways to help keep precious family time as quality time.\n* Spiritual tools
  for the whole family.\n\n**Are you looking for ways to bring more spiritu
 ality**\n**into your life and the life of your family?**\n\nWe will be sha
 ring experiences of being a parent and acknowledging and recognizing our o
 wn inner knowing.\nIt is exciting to share stories and experiences with li
 ke-minded parents. By sharing\, our own inner wisdom can be strengthened a
 nd validated.\nParent discussions offer family-friendly tools in a relaxed
  setting for exploring spiritual truths and how we live them.\nYou're warm
 ly invited to share spiritual insights\, stories\, and experiences\, ask q
 uestions\, or simply listen.\n\n**Parents\, grandparents\, and friends are
  always welcome.**\n\nClick **[HERE](http://www.eckankar.org/explore/paren
 ts-families/)** to learn about spiritual opportunities for parents and fam
 ilies:\n\nClick **[HERE](https://www.adventuresineckparenting.org/se-1/)**
  to read about how family classes or “satsangs” can strengthen your fa
 mily’s spiritual connection.
