SUMMARY:Everything Revolves Around Love—A Sound of Soul Event
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Would you like t
 o experience more love in your life?**\n\n**Are you interested in learning
  a technique that helps you**\n**connect with the purest\, most divine lov
 e?**\n\n**Would feeling this love everyday be important to you?**\n\n“Ev
 erything revolves around love. It always does. No matter how much we rush 
 about in this world and how harried\, ambitious\, or sorrowful we become\,
  the world stays together for some reason. The reason is God’s love.\n\n
 “God’s love is the fabric that draws us all and keeps us here. It make
 s the whole work\,\neven though sometimes it looks like nothing is working
  at all.”\n─Harold Klemp\, *ECK Wisdom on Relationships*\, p. 1\n\nThe
  Sound of Soul is a public event for any who want to experience the uplift
 ing Sound\nof Soul─HU─and the benefits that come from it!\n\n* Listen 
 to a heart-opening spiritual quote\n* Experience a 15-minute HU Chant and 
 quiet contemplation\n* Share your spiritual experiences and ask questions\
 nin a relaxed spiritually-focused conversation\n\n**Chanting HU can bring:
 **\n\n* Comfort\, peace and calm\n* A subtle sense of divine love\n* Expan
 ded awareness\n* A release of fears\n* Answers and inner guidance\n\n**Fam
 ily and friends are always welcome!**\n\nLearn more about how to develop a
  powerful spiritual exercise that can transform your daily life **[HERE](h
 ttps://eckankarblog.org/hu-app/)**\n\nTo hear thousands of people singing 
 HU and to sing along\, download the free HU app **[HERE](https://www.eckan
 kar.org/experience/hu-the-sound-of-soul/)**
