SUMMARY:The Easy Way Spiritual Living Course In-Person Discussion
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Do you want to l
 earn more about Eckankar\, the path of Spiritual Freedom?**\n\n**Are you l
 ooking for a step-by-step path to spiritual transformation?**\n\n**Do you 
 want to discover a deeper understanding of who you truly are as Soul\, a D
 ivine Spark?**\n\n**Is your family seeking ways to bring spirituality into
  the home that's beyond religion?**\n\nIf you're wondering what it means t
 o become an ECK student\, join in on this informative and dynamic discussi
 on. Explore how studying ***The Easy Way Discourses*** can take your spiri
 tual life to the next level.\n\nWe will discuss benefits\, what is involve
 d\, the cost\, how it might fit into your busy life\, when new classes wil
 l be starting\, and so much more!\n\nCome with your questions and curiosit
 y as we explore the ways Eckankar can open your heart to your own personal
 \, unique connection with Divine Spirit.\n\n*"The ECK Spiritual Living Cou
 rses are a living road map to spiritual transformation. Not only revealing
  the path to your goal but providing **high adventure every step of the wa
 y**. Each month brings you a new measure of enlightenment."*\n—Harold\, 
 Klemp\, Spiritual Living Courses\, FAQ page on Eckankar Website
