SUMMARY:Turning Barriers into Bridges — A Spiritual Chat for 18-40 yo
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Are you finding 
 life’s issues are weighing you down?**\n\n**Have you wondered if there i
 s a better way to handle roadblocks in life?**\n\n**Do you want to learn w
 ays to create positive outcomes from problems that arise?**\n\n“Problems
  of one sort or another are always with us in some form or other. They are
  to make us strong.”\n— Harold Klemp\, *Youth Ask a Modern Prophet abo
 ut Life\, Love\, and God*\, p. 15\n\nYou’re warmly invited to this casua
 l and upbeat chat with other young spiritual seekers who want to learn mor
 e about the ways of the Divine. Come and share your stories or listen to o
 thers' stories of how Spirit works uniquely with each of us.\n\n***Explore
 …***\n\n* How to shift your perspective to gain understanding about life
 ’s challenges\n* Spiritual techniques to help you learn how to view diff
 iculties differently\n* Chanting the ancient mantra\, HU\, to pour divine 
 love into a situation\n* Learn about a Spiritual Exercise to help form bri
 dges to your goals.\n\nDrop in when it works for you\, and cameras are alw
 ays optional.\nLooking forward to meeting you!\n\n**Welcome to Eckankar**\
 nThe teachings of ECKANKAR are based on God’s love and spiritual freedom
  for everyone.\n\nThey offer you individual spiritual tools\, whatever you
 r path or religion may be\, to bring you more understanding\, love\, and h
 elp in these challenging times.\n\nCome\, stay as long as you like\, and e
 xplore spiritual resources that can help you\, at your own pace. Feel free
  to come and to go as you wish.\nThere is no pressure\, expectation\, judg
 ment\, or unasked-for follow up.\n\n**We respect your divinity as a spirit
 ual being.**\n\n**We honor your choices and your journey.**
